From 2ca01043b0a3e4d31bdccf908981afac6793c145 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 11:34:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Build complete learnership LMS: full-stack portal with
 uploads, downloads, grading and admin suite

Transform the SS_Portal prototype into a fully functional, deployable
student learning portal for South African SETA learnerships:

Learner features
- Server-side graded module exit quizzes with attempt history, retries,
  and DB-backed drip unlocking (replaces localStorage/client-side JS
  grading that leaked the answer key)
- Learning materials library with permission-checked downloads
- My Documents: upload certified ID copies, CVs, assignments with
  review-status tracking and an onboarding checklist
- Real grades dashboard with competency status and CSV statement of
  results; course enrollment requests with NQF/SAQA/SETA details
- Profile with avatar upload, password change, persisted themes;
  POPIA consent at registration with SA ID validation and masking
- Announcements feed and responsive mobile navigation

Admin suite
- Stats dashboard with registration approvals (fixes invalid 'Accepted'
  enum write), learner management with progress views and password
  resets, material publishing, document review with notes, quiz results
  with CSV export, announcement management, admin account creation

Backend & security
- New domain layer (includes/portal.php) and extended schema: module
  progress, quiz attempts, materials, documents, announcements,
  learnership qualification fields
- setup.php installer that also upgrades v1 databases in place
  (adds columns, repairs legacy statuses, hashes plaintext admin rows)
- Removed public admin self-registration and plaintext password
  fallback; CSRF on all forms; hardened sessions; upload validation
  with whitelists and randomized names; uploads dir blocked from
  direct access, all downloads streamed through download.php
- Fixed CSRF-branch bugs in login/register, BOMs in module wrappers,
  env-driven configuration for deployment

Verified end to end with PHP 8.4 + MariaDB: 58 integration checks
covering registration through full course completion, uploads,
downloads, approvals and access control.

